OL,3,GNEWSAWork on road shut for nearly one
OL,4,Ayear extended again
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a road shut 11 months ago for
OL,7,Fmajor sewer repairs has been extended
OL,8,Fagain.
OL,10,FThe junction of Bennet Road and the A33
OL,11,Fin Reading has been closed since 18
OL,12,FOctober after a trunk sewer, about 1m
OL,13,F(41in) wide, collapsed.
OL,15,FSince then Thames Water has issued
OL,16,Frolling notifications to keep the
OL,17,Fclosure in place, with the latest
OL,18,Flasting until 10 October, close to the
OL,19,Ffirst anniversary of the junction being
OL,20,Fclosed.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
